; List and Dir options (Phase 221)
FailAt 21
Delete work-list ALL QUIET >NIL:
MakeDir work-list
CD work-list
Echo "hello world" >a.txt
Echo "second file with more text" >b.info
MakeDir dir1
Echo "nested" >dir1/c.txt
SetDate a.txt 01-Jan-24 12:00:00
SetDate b.info 02-Feb-23 13:14:15
SetDate dir1 03-Mar-22 01:02:03
SetDate dir1/c.txt 04-Apr-21 04:05:06
List a.txt
List a.txt NODATES
List a.txt DATES
List a.txt BLOCK
List a.txt NOHEAD
List a.txt QUICK
List a.txt LFORMAT "%n|%l|%p|%d|%t|%c|%s|%a|%b"
List a.txt LFORMAT "name=%s size=%l"
List dir1
List dir1 NODATES ALL
List dir1 FILES
List dir1 DIRS
List dir1 LFORMAT "%p%n"
List #?.txt
List PAT #?.info
List SINCE 01-Jan-24
List UPTO 01-Jan-21
List SUB info
List dir1/c.txt dir1/c.txt
List nosuch
Echo "list rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
List a.txt BADOPT
Echo "list rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
List LFORMAT
Echo "list rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Dir dir1
Dir dir1 ALL
Dir dir1 FILES
Dir dir1 DIRS
Dir dir1 OPT A
Dir nosuch
Echo "dir rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
CD /
Delete work-list ALL QUIET
Echo "done"
